下面是一个带 `Transient` 标记的组件成员，代码在强制 GC 后打印两个值。请写出日志输出，并说明 `Transient` 是否影响 GC 可达性：

```cpp
UPROPERTY(Transient)
TObjectPtr<UMyItem> Selected = nullptr;

void UMyInventory::Pick()
{
    UMyItem* Raw = NewObject<UMyItem>(this, TEXT("Item"));
    Selected = Raw;

    GEngine->ForceGarbageCollection(true);
    UE_LOG(LogTemp, Log, TEXT("selected=%d rawNull=%d"),
        IsValid(Selected), Raw == nullptr ? 1 : 0);
}
```

